@startuml identity-context-map
!include _style.puml
title playground-oauth - Context Map (strategic)

' ---- Core subdomain ----
' Account Registration & Authentication (FR-01..FR-06) and Session Management
' (FR-07..FR-10) are FEATURES within this one bounded context, not separate
' contexts — see the feature groupings in docs/requirements/functional.md.
package "Identity & Access\n«Core»" as IDENTITY CORE_COLOR

' ---- External identity providers: undifferentiated «Generic» subdomains we
' integrate with but don't build. Each OAuthIdentityProvider adapter
' (ADR-0002) is the anti-corruption layer translating their model into ours.
package "Google\n«Generic · External»" as GOOGLE EXTERNAL_COLOR
package "Microsoft\n«Generic · External»" as MICROSOFT EXTERNAL_COLOR
package "GitHub\n«Generic · External»" as GITHUB EXTERNAL_COLOR

IDENTITY ..> GOOGLE : «ACL»
IDENTITY ..> MICROSOFT : «ACL»
IDENTITY ..> GITHUB : «ACL»

' ---- PLANNED, NOT BUILT: kept here as a commented placeholder so the
' strategic shape isn't lost if a fourth provider is ever added — not a
' decision, and not reflected in code. Un-comment (and write the ADR/FRs)
' if it's actually pursued. ----
' package "Okta\n«Generic · External · planned»" as OKTA PLANNED_COLOR
' IDENTITY ..> OKTA : «planned ACL»

@enduml
